  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut/master/.github/assets/logo/logo.png\" alt=\"Friends&amp;Foes - 養蜂人小屋\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Buy Me a Coffee&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"請我喝咖啡\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Become a Patron&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon\" alt=\"成為贊助者\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/924964658169913404?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&label=Join Our Discord&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"加入我們的 Discord\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Wiki&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"維基\"> </a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Friends&amp;Foes - 養蜂人小屋是一個小型附加模組，新增了養蜂人小屋結構。此結構可在草甸與繁花森林生物群系中找到。您可以查看 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基頁面</a> 以獲取更多關於養蜂人的資訊。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fimages%252fbeekeeper_hut1.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut/master/.github/assets/images/beekeeper_hut1.png\" alt=\"養蜂人小屋\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fimages%252fbeekeeper_hut2.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut/master/.github/assets/images/beekeeper_hut2.png\" alt=\"養蜂人小屋\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">⚙️ 其他附加模組 / 資料包</span></p>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Friends&amp;Foes - Flowery Mooblooms</a></li>\n<li><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/repurposed-structures-friends-and-foes-datapack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Repurposed Structures - Friends and Foes 相容性資料包</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">💬 社群</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我們的 Discord 伺服器社群</a> 進行聊天、分享您的創作、提出任何問題，或單純獲取模組的最新開發動態與新版本發布通知。也請隨時透過 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub Issues 回報任何崩潰或錯誤</a>。</span></p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">👋 支援</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">無論是否有獲得支援，我都會繼續開發我的模組，因為這是我的興趣，儘管我大部分的閒餘時間都投入在模組開發上。因此，如果您仍然希望支援我，可以透過 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 或 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-fi</a> 進行。在此同時，我非常感謝大家的所有支援。</span></p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">📜 授權條款</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模組採用 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut%252fmaster%252fLICENSE.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC BY-NC-ND 4.0</a> 授權條款。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎參考我的程式碼，了解我在開發此模組時如何實現並解決各種問題，並將相關程式碼片段融入您自己的作品中。此外，也歡迎將本模組用於任何整合包中（若能註明出處或連結回本頁面將不勝感激）。</span></p>",
